# --- Assistant working directory ------------------------------------------
# Session notes and verification screenshots. Remove this entry if the team
# wants to version .workbuddy-ai/ (e.g. shared project skills).
.workbuddy-ai/

# --- Design tooling (hallmark) --------------------------------------------
# Tool artifacts, not project source. The design system that actually ships is
# the :root token block inside frontend/src/styles.css - that is the live
# source of truth. design.md and tokens.css are portable copies the skill
# emits, and tokens.css duplicates the same values, so versioning it invites
# the two copies to drift. .hallmark/ is the skill's run log.
# Delete these lines if the team ever wants to version the design system.
.hallmark/
/design.md
/tokens.css
